<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="531051596"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1538286302"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="PRIMALove"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="ClariS"/><amll:meta key="album" value="PRIMALove (期間限定盤)"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="03:52.075"><div begin="00:09.998" end="03:52.215"><p begin="00:09.998" end="00:17.766" itunes:key="L29290">遠い 遠い 遠い 未来の夢を見たんだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">梦见了</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">to o i to o i to o i</span></p><p begin="00:17.897" end="00:22.931" itunes:key="L29291">まどろみの中で<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在微睡之中</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma do ro mi no na ka de</span></p><p begin="00:23.295" end="00:31.087" itunes:key="L29292">知らない景色を歩いて考えてた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">行走在未知的景色</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">shi ra na i ke shi ki wo a ru i te ka n ga e te ta</span></p><p begin="00:31.095" end="00:35.649" itunes:key="L29293">ほんとの明日を<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">思考着真正的明天</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ho n to u no a shi ta wo</span></p><p begin="00:35.699" end="00:42.266" itunes:key="L29294">1年後のスケジュールだってわからないけど<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">虽然不知道</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i chi ne n go no su ke ju u ru da 't te</span></p><p begin="00:42.338" end="00:49.122" itunes:key="L29295">一つだけ確かなことがあるの<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但是有一件事可以确定</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">hi to tsu da ke ta shi ka na ko to ga a ru no</span></p><p begin="00:49.132" end="00:51.981" itunes:key="L29296">何百年経ったって<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就算过了几百年</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na n bya ku ne n ta 't ta 't te</span></p><p begin="00:51.991" end="00:55.334" itunes:key="L29297">私たちは恋をする<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们依旧会相爱</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wa ta shi ta chi wa ko i wo su ru</span></p><p begin="00:55.344" end="00:56.935" itunes:key="L29298">傷ついて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不断重复着</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki zu tsu i te ma e mu i te wo</span></p><p begin="00:56.945" end="00:58.587" itunes:key="L29299">前向いてを<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">迈向前方</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki zu tsu i te ma e mu i te wo</span></p><p begin="00:58.597" end="01:02.319" itunes:key="L29300">繰り返していくんだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即使受伤也会不断前进的过程</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ku ri ka e shi te i ku n da</span></p><p begin="01:02.329" end="01:05.183" itunes:key="L29301">宇宙まで届くビルも<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">高耸入天的大楼也好 流光溢彩的街道也好</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so ra ma de to do ku bi ru mo hi ka ri ma u ma chi na mi mo</span></p><p begin="01:05.193" end="01:08.523" itunes:key="L29302">光舞う街並みも<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">还是那光彩夺目的绚烂街景</span></p><p begin="01:08.533" end="01:10.171" itunes:key="L29303">大切な<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这份重要的心情也都不要变</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ta i se tsu na ko no ki mo chi ka e na i de</span></p><p begin="01:10.181" end="01:11.874" itunes:key="L29304">この気持ち<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">扭曲这份</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ta i se tsu na ko no ki mo chi ka e na i de</span></p><p begin="01:11.884" end="01:14.810" itunes:key="L29305">変えないで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">珍贵的感情</span></p><p begin="01:14.922" end="01:23.128" itunes:key="L29306">PRIMALove<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">PRIMALove</span></p><p begin="01:29.491" end="01:37.208" itunes:key="L29307">何気なく過ごしていた日々もずっと<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无意间度过的那些日子</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na ni ge na ku su go shi te i ta hi bi mo</span></p><p begin="01:37.294" end="01:42.214" itunes:key="L29308">先へ繋がってる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">也始终铺垫着通往明天的路</span></p><p begin="01:42.742" end="01:50.256" itunes:key="L29309">この場所も誰かが見てた未来なら<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如果这里也是谁在看着的未来</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko no ba sho mo da re ka ga mi te ta mi ra i na ra</span></p><p begin="01:50.549" end="01:55.066" itunes:key="L29310">笑っていなくちゃね<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那就一定要笑着了呢</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wa ra 't te i na ku cha ne</span></p><p begin="01:55.129" end="02:01.425" itunes:key="L29311">言葉ができる前も言葉が変わっても<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在语言形成之前也好</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko to ba ga de ki ru ma e mo</span></p><p begin="02:01.795" end="02:08.531" itunes:key="L29312">同じように明日を夢見ている<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一样会做着未来的梦</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">o na ji yo u ni a su wo yu me mi te i ru</span></p><p begin="02:08.541" end="02:11.433" itunes:key="L29313">何百年前だって<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就算是几百年前我们也是相爱的</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na n bya ku ne n ma e da 't te wa ta shi ta chi wa ko i shi te ta</span></p><p begin="02:11.443" end="02:14.785" itunes:key="L29314">私たちは恋してた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们便一同坠入了爱河</span></p><p begin="02:14.795" end="02:16.435" itunes:key="L29315">泣いたって<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">也是不断地哭泣着</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na i ta 't te o chi ko n da 't te</span></p><p begin="02:16.445" end="02:18.077" itunes:key="L29316">落ち込んだって<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一蹶不振</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na i ta 't te o chi ko n da 't te</span></p><p begin="02:18.087" end="02:21.785" itunes:key="L29317">繰り返してきたんだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">消沉着渡过的</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ku ri ka e shi te ki ta n da</span></p><p begin="02:21.795" end="02:24.683" itunes:key="L29318">今見えてる空も<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如今所见的天空也好 昨日的雨点也好</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i ma mi e te ru so ra mo ki no u no a ma mo yo u mo</span></p><p begin="02:24.693" end="02:28.033" itunes:key="L29319">昨日の雨模様も<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">还是昨日的雨天</span></p><p begin="02:28.043" end="02:29.634" itunes:key="L29320">大切な<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">都和这份重要的心情紧紧相连</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ta i se tsu na ko no ki mo chi tsu na ge te ru</span></p><p begin="02:29.644" end="02:31.286" itunes:key="L29321">この気持ち<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">珍贵的感情</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ta i se tsu na ko no ki mo chi tsu na ge te ru</span></p><p begin="02:31.296" end="02:34.167" itunes:key="L29322">繋げてる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">紧紧相连</span></p><p begin="02:34.480" end="02:42.671" itunes:key="L29323">PRIMALove<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">PRIMALove</span></p><p begin="02:48.684" end="02:55.185" itunes:key="L29324">一つ二つ積み重なってく今が<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一点一滴积累形成的如今</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">hi to tsu fu ta tsu tsu mi ka sa na 't te ku i ma ga</span></p><p begin="02:55.324" end="03:01.785" itunes:key="L29325">私たちが知らない未来になる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">变成了我们未知的未来</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wa ta shi ta chi ga shi ra na i mi ra i ni na ru</span></p><p begin="03:01.937" end="03:04.377" itunes:key="L29326">どんなときも<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无论什么时候 都一定有一个人</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">do n na to ki mo ki 't to da re ka ga so ko de</span></p><p begin="03:04.387" end="03:08.346" itunes:key="L29327">きっと誰かがそこで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">都一定会有谁</span></p><p begin="03:08.349" end="03:14.054" itunes:key="L29328">誰かを好きになってる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">喜欢上了另一个人</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">da re ka wo su ki ni na 't te ru</span></p><p begin="03:14.782" end="03:17.631" itunes:key="L29329">何百年経ったって<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就算过了几百年</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na n bya ku ne n ta 't ta 't te</span></p><p begin="03:17.641" end="03:20.933" itunes:key="L29330">私たちは恋をする<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们依旧会相爱</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wa ta shi ta chi wa ko i wo su ru</span></p><p begin="03:20.943" end="03:22.634" itunes:key="L29331">傷ついて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不断重复着</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki zu tsu i te ma e mu i te wo</span></p><p begin="03:22.644" end="03:24.285" itunes:key="L29332">前向いてを<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">迈向前方</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki zu tsu i te ma e mu i te wo</span></p><p begin="03:24.295" end="03:27.971" itunes:key="L29333">繰り返していくんだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即使受伤也会不断前进的过程</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ku ri ka e shi te i ku n da</span></p><p begin="03:27.982" end="03:30.862" itunes:key="L29334">宇宙まで届くビルも<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">高耸入天的大楼也好</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so ra ma de to do ku bi ru mo</span></p><p begin="03:30.872" end="03:34.188" itunes:key="L29335">光舞う街並みも<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">流光溢彩的街道也好</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">hi ka ri ma u ma chi na mi mo</span></p><p begin="03:34.198" end="03:35.832" itunes:key="L29336">大切な<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这份重要的心情也都不要变</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ta i se tsu na ko no ki mo chi ka e na i de</span></p><p begin="03:35.842" end="03:37.531" itunes:key="L29337">この気持ち<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">扭曲这份</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ta i se tsu na ko no ki mo chi ka e na i de</span></p><p begin="03:37.541" end="03:40.344" itunes:key="L29338">変えないで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">珍贵的感情</span></p><p begin="03:40.687" end="03:52.215" itunes:key="L29339">PRIMALove,  PRIMALove<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">PRIMALove</span></p></div></body></tt>